evals.prompt:
Our Python 3.10 telemetry importer streams integer samples from a large file. A preview panel now receives a one-shot iterable of text lines and needs exactly the same samples. Here's the existing public entry point:

def samples(path):
    with open(path, encoding="utf-8") as stream:
        for line in stream:
            field = line.partition("#")[0].strip()
            if field:
                yield int(field)

